{title: Lantern Road}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Down the lantern [C]road we go
[G]Every window [D]all aglow
[G]Footsteps on the [C]frozen snow
[D]Taking the long way [G]home
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Oh lantern road, [G]carry me
[D]Over the hill and [G]out to sea
[C]Oh lantern road, [G]carry me
[D]Home to where I [G]used to be
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Bakers' ovens [C]warm the street
[G]Children running [D]on their feet
[G]Every neighbour [C]that we meet
[D]Waves us down the [G]road
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Oh lantern road, [G]carry me
[D]Over the hill and [G]out to sea
[C]Oh lantern road, [G]carry me
[D]Home to where I [G]used to be
{end_of_chorus}
